  "seed": "Grabbing the layer (picture-keys.html): on a layer with a keyed Rotation a press in its middle moves the layer, never a pivot. A real click on the Rotation row brings the crosshair up, and the same drag then moves the pivot and writes no Position key. Next defaults.",
